    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy Kids is a casual game consisting of 6 mini games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the difference - Find the difference between two pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egg catch - Control the direction and strength of the chicken to shoot the egg onto the frying pan held by the chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring - Draw a picture using various paints and brushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the same picture - Find two identical pictures among several pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the song - Press when the small circle coming out from the center enters the large circle around it to match the beat of the song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece puzzle - Match the pieced picture to the original picture.</p>",
